  --> ./tests/cases/lambdas/err_lambdas.aipl:36:35
   |
36 |     print(to_str([1, 2, 3].filter(twice)));
   |                                   ^^^^^

error: lambda body returns i64, but bool was expected
  --> ./tests/cases/lambdas/err_lambdas.aipl:40:39
   |
40 |     print(to_str([1, 2, 3].filter(|x| x + 1)));
   |                                       ^^^^^

